.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH halp 1  "halp 0.2.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
halp \- A CLI tool to get help with CLI tools 🐙
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBhalp\fR [\fB\-\-check\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-help\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-timeout\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fICMD\fR> [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
A CLI tool to get help with CLI tools 🐙
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR=\fIARG\fR
Sets the argument to check
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-version\fR
Disable checking the version information
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-help\fR
Disable checking the help information
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR=\fIPATH\fR
Sets the configuration file
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBHALP_CONFIG\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-timeout\fR=\fIS\fR
Sets the timeout for the command
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enables verbose logging
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fICMD\fR>
Command or binary name
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
halp\-plz(1)
Get additional help
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v0.2.0
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
